<title>UK: BGL adds 25 million euros to six-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>BGL adds 25 million euros to six-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Generale du Luxembourg SA has increased a recent six-year bond issue to 100 million euros from 75 million euros, it said on Wednesaday.</p>
<p>The new paper has a 102.00 issue price.</p>
<p>The deal was launched on May 12 at 102.04.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN EUR0  COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    27.JUN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    27.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  LUX</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.75</p>
<p> NOTES    **SEE TEXT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
